msg01.mp4	Hubberry team, this is Grace Wanjiru, the CHV from Rongai. I want to report on today's family planning outreach at Campi Amoto dispensary. We started at 9 in the morning with a short talk on the different methods then the nurse, Sister Mary Chebet, gave services. In total, 42 women came and most of them were young mothers. 6 women were referred to Rongai Health Centre for implants because we ran out of stock. One mama asked to be called for follow-up, her number is 0711000482. I will send the register tomorrow. Thank you.
msg02.mp4	Good evening everyone, it's faith aching. I was also at the Campiamoto outreach today with grace. Just to confirm the numbers, we served 42 women on family planning and 6 were referred for implants. The turnout was very good even though the rain started around noon. The women asked if we can come back next month, so maybe we can plan that. If anyone needs the photos, call me on 0722 000 917 and I will share them on WhatsApp. Asante
